WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.781 --> 00:00:14.502
greeted the kids in the farmyard.

2
00:00:14.522 --> 00:00:18.423
"We're making strawberry shortcake today.

3
00:00:19.304 --> 00:00:21.044
Please pick some strawberries in the garden.

4
00:00:21.905 --> 00:00:23.205
I'll get things ready inside."

5
00:00:25.266 --> 00:00:26.607
Nina bounced up and down.

6
00:00:26.627 --> 00:00:29.588
"I love strawberry shortcake!"

7
00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:31.705
Bobby chuckled.

8
00:00:31.725 --> 00:00:35.627
"Of course you do!"

9
00:00:35.647 --> 00:00:38.789
"Hey!" Jason said.

10
00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:42.611
"That's a great nickname for you—Shortcake!"

11
00:00:43.812 --> 00:00:44.852
Nina glared at him.

12
00:00:44.872 --> 00:00:47.033
"Don't call me that."

13
00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:49.835
Bobby and Jason laughed.

14
00:00:51.236 --> 00:00:52.517
Izzie frowned at the boys.

15
00:00:55.698 --> 00:00:58.240
The kids picked the strawberries and took them to the kitchen.

16
00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.781
"Let's get started," Chef said.

17
00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:10.905
we'll wash the strawberries and remove the leaves."

18
00:01:12.326 --> 00:01:14.687
Next, everyone sliced the strawberries.

19
00:01:15.627 --> 00:01:18.569
Izzie preheated the oven while Chef greased a square pan.

20
00:01:18.589 --> 00:01:20.990
"We need a large mixing bowl.

21
00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:22.931
Would someone get one, please?"

22
00:01:24.191 --> 00:01:24.671
"I will!"

23
00:01:24.992 --> 00:01:25.632
Nina said.

24
00:01:29.068 --> 00:01:30.549
The bowl was on a high shelf.

25
00:01:32.129 --> 00:01:34.891
She stood on a stool, but she still couldn't reach it.

26
00:01:34.911 --> 00:01:39.493
"Need some help, Shortcake?"

27
00:01:40.873 --> 00:01:42.754
Bobby stretched up and got it.

28
00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:45.215
Nina frowned.

29
00:01:45.235 --> 00:01:48.076
"I don't like that nickname!"

30
00:01:49.417 --> 00:01:51.218
Jason was reading the instructions.

31
00:01:51.238 --> 00:01:56.020
"We have to mix soft butter and sugar in a large bowl."

32
00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.021
Izzie mixed the butter and sugar until it was fluffy.

33
00:02:02.361 --> 00:02:04.102
Then she added an egg and vanilla.

34
00:02:04.122 --> 00:02:08.683
"I'll get the dry ingredients ready," Jason said.

35
00:02:10.064 --> 00:02:12.984
He mixed flour, salt, and baking powder together.

36
00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:20.346
mix in half of the dry ingredients and milk," Chef said.

37
00:02:20.366 --> 00:02:22.647
"We only do half at a time.

38
00:02:23.627 --> 00:02:25.908
This keeps the shortcake from getting too thick."

39
00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.462
Jason and Bobby added their ingredients, and Izzie stirred.

40
00:02:30.482 --> 00:02:32.243
"And repeat!"

41
00:02:32.743 --> 00:02:33.384
Izzie said.

42
00:02:34.544 --> 00:02:37.786
Jason and Bobby added the rest of the dry ingredients and milk.

43
00:02:38.727 --> 00:02:39.967
And Izzie stirred again.

44
00:02:41.668 --> 00:02:43.729
Nina was watching everyone make the batter.

45
00:02:43.749 --> 00:02:47.672
"Cooking isn't fun today," she thought.

46
00:02:47.692 --> 00:02:51.534
"Everything is well combined," Chef said.

47
00:02:51.554 --> 00:02:55.236
"Nina, please spread the batter in the pan."

48
00:02:56.364 --> 00:02:58.885
"Okay," Nina said softly.

49
00:03:03.927 --> 00:03:05.368
Chef put the pan in the oven.

50
00:03:07.489 --> 00:03:09.490
"The shortcake bakes for 25 minutes.

51
00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.230
Let's make the whipped cream."

52
00:03:15.292 --> 00:03:20.234
"We need heavy whipping cream, sugar, and vanilla," Izzie said.

53
00:03:21.855 --> 00:03:23.556
Bobby whipped everything with a mixer.

54
00:03:24.864 --> 00:03:28.227
"Whipped cream is ready when it forms peaks," Chef said.

55
00:03:29.388 --> 00:03:31.369
He put a whisk in the mixture to check it.

56
00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:35.093
When he lifted it, Nina saw peaks in the cream.

57
00:03:36.434 --> 00:03:37.274
Bobby grinned.

58
00:03:37.294 --> 00:03:39.436
"It's perfect!"

59
00:03:42.579 --> 00:03:45.521
While the shortcake finished baking, the kids cleaned up.

60
00:03:47.162 --> 00:03:49.244
Then they took the food scraps outside.

61
00:03:49.264 --> 00:03:55.360
"The boys keep teasing me today," Nina whispered to Izzie.

62
00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:59.141
"I noticed," Izzie said.

63
00:03:59.161 --> 00:04:02.082
"Maybe—" "Woof!"

64
00:04:03.623 --> 00:04:05.663
Cinnamon was pacing near the chicken coop.

65
00:04:07.504 --> 00:04:08.824
"What's wrong, Cinnamon?"

66
00:04:09.164 --> 00:04:10.005
Jason asked.

67
00:04:11.385 --> 00:04:12.645
Bobby looked under the coop.

68
00:04:12.665 --> 00:04:15.886
"A baby chick is stuck."

69
00:04:17.007 --> 00:04:18.907
He reached for it but couldn't get it.

70
00:04:19.947 --> 00:04:21.828
He was too big to fit under the coop.

71
00:04:23.348 --> 00:04:24.008
"I'll try."

72
00:04:27.409 --> 00:04:30.230
Nina slid under the coop and pulled the tiny chick out.

73
00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.871
"Wow!" Bobby said.

74
00:04:33.891 --> 00:04:36.672
"Nina saved the day!"

75
00:04:38.012 --> 00:04:38.853
Nina grinned.

76
00:04:38.873 --> 00:04:42.094
"Sometimes it's good to be short!"

77
00:04:44.614 --> 00:04:46.835
Back inside, the shortcake was ready.

78
00:04:48.615 --> 00:04:50.056
Chef cut it into squares.

79
00:04:52.608 --> 00:04:55.250
The kids put strawberries and whipped cream on each serving.

80
00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:59.192
"Mmm. This is yummy!"

81
00:04:59.692 --> 00:05:00.373
Nina said.

82
00:05:01.694 --> 00:05:02.874
Bobby patted her back.

83
00:05:02.894 --> 00:05:04.996
"Of course it is.

84
00:05:05.936 --> 00:05:07.417
We like shortcake."

85
00:05:08.398 --> 00:05:09.358
Jason grinned.

86
00:05:09.378 --> 00:05:11.600
"And we like Nina."
